<h1>Rendering Smooth + Wireframe and Smooth + Wireframe Mode</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span class="Command">Rendering Smooth + Wireframe</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>tree context menu &gt; Rendering &gt; Smooth + Wireframe</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p><span class="Mode" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Smooth + Wireframe</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode is accessible from the</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>viewport context menu &gt; Render Mode &gt; Smooth</b></span> </i><span lang="EN-GB">or by pressing</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>7</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">These commands affect visual representation of scan data and meshes only. This mode is a combination of <a href="Rendering_Smooth_and_Smooth_Shaded_Mode.htm">Smooth</a> and <a href="Rendering_Polygons_and_Polygons_Mode.htm">Wireframe</a> modes..</span></p>
<p><span class="Command">Rendering Smooth + Wireframe</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is applied to a particular entity (or group of entities) from which the context menu was called.</span></p>
<p><span class="Mode" style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;"><b>Smooth + Wireframe</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode is applied to all scan data and meshes in the scene.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP167226598" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/Image272.jpg" width="635px" height="391px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">To switch between</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Smooth</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Smooth + Wireframe</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">modes use <a href="Toggle_Wireframe.htm">Toggle Wireframe</a> command.</span></p>
